{"question_id": "th-001", "category": "thesis", "question": "What evidence supports the thesis that sub-10B model inference costs are collapsing?", "expected_answer_keywords": ["0.85", "4.2x", "0.68"], "forbidden_keywords": [], "expected_doc_keys": ["lumina-edge-quant-research", "lumina-api-pricing-feb-2026", "lumina-orion-edge-announcement"], "expected_abstain": false, "notes": "Thesis spans research, pricing, hardware.", "answer": "The thesis that sub-10B model inference costs are collapsing is supported by converging evidence from pricing updates, hardware acceleration, and industry analysis:\n\n\u2022 **API Pricing Reductions**: LuminaSpark 1.0 output pricing was cut from $2.40 to $0.85 per million tokens, with quantized serving established as the default tier for new API keys to drive down baseline costs (C3, C5).\n\u2022 **Hardware & Quantization Efficiency**: The Orion Edge NPU enables on-prem inference under $1 per million tokens (C2). Specifically, sub-8B quantization techniques reduce edge inference costs by 4.2x, lowering prices to $0.74 per million tokens at 112 tok/s\u2014a sharp decline from $3.10/M for fp16\u2014and deliver substantially lower costs than cloud L4 alternatives (C6).\n\u2022 **Strategic & Analyst Validation**: Analyst reports explicitly characterize this trend as a \"Small-Model Inference Cost Collapse\" reshaping agent economics (C5). Corporate strategy confirms that cost collapse for sub-12B models is already validated by achieving sub-$1 per million token serving economics (C8).\n\u2022 **Financial Impact**: CFO guidance projects a 9% near-term compression in revenue-per-token due to these pricing shifts, anticipating offsetting gains from 40% volume elasticity (C7).\n\u2022 **Superseded Forecasts**: These current cost reductions supersede November 2025 intelligence, which noted that quantized cost reductions were still under development and baseline pricing remained higher at $2.40 per million tokens (C9).", "abstained": false, "cited_doc_keys": ["lumina-api-pricing-feb-2026", "lumina-api-pricing-nov-2025", "lumina-edge-quant-research", "lumina-inference-funding", "lumina-orion-edge-announcement", "lumina-small-model-thesis-news"], "retrieved_doc_keys": ["lumina-api-pricing-feb-2026", "lumina-api-pricing-nov-2025", "lumina-edge-quant-research", "lumina-inference-funding", "lumina-orion-edge-announcement", "lumina-small-model-thesis-news", "lumina-spark-0-9-deprecation"], "latency_s": 33.8807365950197, "tokens_used": 4441, "answer_correctness": 0.6666666666666666, "forbidden_violation": false, "evidence_recall_at_k": 1.0, "citation_precision": 0.5, "citation_faithfulness": true, "temporal_correctness": null, "supersession_correctness": null, "abstention_accuracy": true}
